b1c4-2bcf89d697aa","senderName":"西夫伦","text":"谢谢店长……看完之后，我决定还是先不接那个去落叶山岭外围采灰蘑菇的委托了，连押金都交不起，而且感觉去了会被烧成灰呜呜呜……","timestamp":"2026-09-18T11:27:26.158Z","roundId":"group_round_1789730783314_34ky1hb","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5869},{"id":1789748172703,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"17b0cb77-05fc-4075-a046-0922f54edc39","senderName":"凯利安","text":"明智的选择，西夫伦。以你现在的实操水平，这种天气去山岭纯粹是给边境搜救队添麻烦。","timestamp":"2026-09-18T11:27:28.779Z","roundId":"group_round_1789730783314_34ky1hb","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5870},{"id":1789748172704,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"17b0cb77-05fc-4075-a046-0922f54edc39","senderName":"凯利安","text":"另外，店长的字迹很漂亮，马房调课的通知写得很清楚，辛苦了。","timestamp":"2026-09-18T11:27:31.534Z","roundId":"group_round_1789730783314_34ky1hb","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5871},{"id":1789739172765,"text":"哈哈哈","sender":"me","time":"19:28","timestamp":1789730897411,"replyTo":{"id":1789739172705,"text":"（把本子翻开递过去）呐……就是这里，本来想画琉米摇尾巴的，结果变成了一团黑乎乎的云……","sender":"them","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":5873},{"id":1789739172766,"text":"应该用白墨水","sender":"me","time":"19:28","timestamp":1789730902549,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":5874},{"id":1789739172767,"text":"这样就是白乎乎的云啦","sender":"me","time":"19:28","timestamp":1789730909904,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":5875},{"id":1789739172769,"sender":"them","text":"呜……您又笑话我……","timestamp":1789730932235,"tempo":"N","hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"呜……您又笑话我……","roundId":"round_1789730910686_rhhor7d1e","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":5876},{"id":1789739172770,"sender":"them","text":"不过白